---
// An inline footnote that opens in a hover / click popover — the Atlas's tool
// for keeping the main text lean: park a caveat, a citation, a number, or a
// verification note in a superscript marker the reader reveals *in place*,
// instead of swelling the sentence or exiling the detail to a list at the foot
// of the page.
//
//   Kolu is N-dominated.<Footnote>Of 66 raw findings, 35 survived verification.</Footnote>
//
// Reveal      hover the marker, or keyboard-focus it (Tab).
// Pin         click the marker — the popover stays until you click away or press
//             Escape. This is also the touch path, where there is no hover.
// Numbering   pure CSS counters (`kolu-footnote`, reset per page on `.prose` in
//             AtlasLayout), so it needs no JS and renumbers automatically when
//             footnotes are added, removed, or reordered.
// Content     any MDX — links, <code>, <PrLink>, <Cite>, short paragraphs.
//
// Reveal (hover/focus) and numbering are pure CSS, so a footnote is readable
// even before — or without — JS. The behaviour CSS can't express (click-to-pin,
// outside-click / Escape dismiss, a viewport clamp so a marker near the right or
// bottom edge doesn't push its popover off-screen) is a single page-level
// `is:inline` runtime rendered once by AtlasLayout (FootnoteRuntime.astro), so N
// footnotes share one script instead of duplicating it N times.
---

<span class="fn" data-fn>
  <button type="button" class="fn-ref" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Footnote"
    ><span class="fn-num" aria-hidden="true"></span></button
  ><span class="fn-pop" role="tooltip"><span class="fn-pop-inner"><slot /></span></span>
</span>

<style>
  .fn {
    position: relative;
    display: inline;
  }

  /* ── the superscript marker ─────────────────────────────── */
  .fn-ref {
    font: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    /* raised + smaller, but a real (non-zero) box so it stays a usable click
       and touch target — never line-height:0, which collapses the hit area */
    display: inline-block;
    vertical-align: super;
    font-size: 0.72em;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0 0.05em;
    padding: 0.1em 0.2em;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 4px;
    background: none;
    color: var(--amber);
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-weight: 650;
    /* CSS counter → auto-number, reset per page on .prose. No JS. */
    counter-increment: kolu-footnote;
  }
  .fn-num::before {
    content: counter(kolu-footnote);
  }
  .fn-ref:hover,
  .fn-ref:focus-visible {
    color: var(--alert);
    background: var(--code-bg);
  }
  .fn-ref:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--amber);
    outline-offset: 2px;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .fn.is-pinned .fn-ref {
    color: var(--alert);
  }

  /* ── the popover ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .fn-pop {
    display: none;
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 40;
    top: calc(100% + 0.45rem);
    left: 50%;
    /* JS nudges --fn-x to pull an edge-hugging popover back on-screen */
    transform: translateX(calc(-50% + var(--fn-x, 0px)));
    width: max-content;
    max-width: min(23rem, 88vw);
    padding: 0.7rem 0.85rem;
    text-align: left;
    white-space: normal;
    cursor: auto;
    color: var(--ink-dim);
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow:
      0 8px 28px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.16),
      0 2px 6px rgba(16, 24, 40, 0.08);
  }
  /* flipped above the marker when it would overflow the bottom edge */
  .fn-pop.fn-pop-above {
    top: auto;
    bottom: calc(100% + 0.45rem);
  }
  .fn:hover > .fn-pop,
  .fn:focus-within > .fn-pop,
  .fn.is-pinned > .fn-pop {
    display: block;
  }

  .fn-pop-inner {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    /* a numbered tab so a pinned popover still says which note it is */
  }
  .fn-pop-inner::before {
    content: counter(kolu-footnote);
    float: left;
    margin: 0.05rem 0.5rem 0.1rem 0;
    padding: 0 0.4em;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--amber);
    background: var(--code-bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 5px;
  }
  .fn-pop-inner :global(> :first-child) {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .fn-pop-inner :global(> :last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
  .fn-pop-inner :global(p) {
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
